      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "This appears to be an issue specifically with this world. It does not use the Post Processing v2 stack but instead a custom shader-based post processing. This is apparently disabled in the handheld camera, although since it's in a shader I cannot tell you why or how. I recommend contacting the world author.\n\nThe built-in camera does capture almost all post processing effects accurately. If you find another world where this doesn't work please let us know.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
