  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The VRChat camera doesn’t capture post-processing effects normally, which can make the image appear a bit duller than it should in some cases. The first image is a screenshot showing how the world is supposed to look. The second image is from the VRChat camera.\n\nWorld: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_6b28bf6c-78e3-4b44-8c95-21e91000b61e",
